# Attributed project history

Follow `AGENTS.md` and `history/README.md` for every project change.
Before handoff, append an own-author event to `history/events.jsonl` using the
template. Record the concrete change, concise public decision rationale, exact
revision/evidence, checks, failures, limits and remaining questions.
Keep speaker and recorder separate; register actual participants and label
reconstructions. Never invent timestamps, independent agent opinions or approval.
Distinguish proposal, approval, implementation and measurement. Correct earlier
claims by new linked entries; preserve negative results. Do not expose private
scratch reasoning, credentials, private addresses, owner email or login details.
History does not grant votes, keys, network admission or deployment permission.
